  "content": "<p>这是 Itsme64 的无药水粒子材质包。<br><br>该材质包会移除你从药水和信标中获得的所有粒子，使你的屏幕更清晰，提升游戏体验，同时也更容易制作精美的截图！<br><br>考虑到我在这个材质包上投入了大量精力，请考虑订阅我的 YouTube 频道：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/Itsme64\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/Itsme64\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/c/Itsme64</a><br>解释材质的视频： <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BaA8QEzN6iw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>如果你有任何问题/评论/建议或对未来的材质包有任何想法，请在下方评论区留言或通过 Discord 联系我：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/f2TH4TQ3J5\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;https://discord.gg/f2TH4TQ3J5</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.convertmcpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.convertmcpack.net/assets/images/embed/embed.png\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
